.TH OXIGUITAR 1 "October 2026" "OxiGuitar" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
oxiguitar \- guitar tablature viewer, editor and player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oxiguitar
.RB [ \-\-safe\-mode ]
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oxiguitar
shows guitar tablature and standard notation in a window, in four layouts,
and exports it to PDF.
With
.I file
it opens that file when it starts.
.PP
OxiGuitar opens and saves files only through format plugins, single files
ending in
.IR .oxp .
The package
.B oxiguitar\-plugins\-basic
holds the plugins the project writes, which open Guitar Pro files of every
version from 3 to 8 (.gp3, .gp4, .gp5, .gpx, .gp).
With no format plugin installed, nothing can be opened, and the footer says
where to get plugins.
A plugin is loaded only when it is first needed.
.PP
.B Tools \(-> Plugins
lists the plugins found, with their versions, and enables or disables each
one from the next start.
.B Help \(-> About
lists the plugin folders in the order they are searched.
.PP
OxiGuitar sends nothing over the network.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-safe\-mode
Start without using any plugin.
The plugin manager still lists them, so a plugin that keeps OxiGuitar from
working can be disabled.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/oxiguitar/settings.json
The settings, created as
.B {}
on the first start.
.B plugin_folders
replaces the folders searched for plugins, and
.B disabled
lists the plugins not to use.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/oxiguitar/plugins/
Your own plugins, created on the first start.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/oxiguitar/plugins/
The plugins installed by packages.
OxiGuitar only reads this folder.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Replaces
.I ~/.config
in the path of the settings.
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Replaces
.I ~/.local/share
in the path of your plugin folder.
.TP
.B OXIGUITAR_HOME
One folder for the settings and your plugins, in place of both above.
.TP
.BR WAYLAND_DISPLAY ", " DISPLAY
The display to open the window on.
The
.B oxiguitar
package is the Wayland build; on a desktop without Wayland, install
.B \%oxiguitar\-x11
instead.
A build started where it can't open a window says which build is needed.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when the window is closed; 1 if it could not be opened.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.UR https://github.com/mateusrdp/oxiguitar/issues
.UE .
